5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I’d like to understand how our seating affects our daily conversations. Who else cares about that?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I care about who ends up with the worse seats. We should decide that deliberately, not by accident.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m worried about the cost. The budget hasn’t changed, but we’re adding desks. I want to know what this floor actually costs us monthly.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I’m worried about how the layout eats into my short gaps between meetings. I want to know what it costs us in time, both during the move and every morning after.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I care about comfort. Eight hours at one desk means sound and posture matter more than the floor plan. I want that written down.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Thank you all for sharing. Toshio, your point about fairness is wise. Daisuke, I understand your worry about the budget.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Shizue, I appreciate the kindness. But kindness doesn't fix a bad layout. We need to look at the data to see who is actually disadvantaged.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I agree with Toshio. Data is safer than guessing. I’ll look into the billing basis and the facilities quote to see the real numbers.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I’ll check the morning routine upstairs and the unplanned shuffles. I need to see exactly how much time we lose during changes and daily setup.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll check the sound meter readings and the physio’s note. Comfort isn’t a luxury; it’s a requirement.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the drawn plan against the staff survey and what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I’ll examine the badge records and the two project strands. I need to see how arrival times and proximity actually shape our workflow.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I already chose the billing and the quote. I’m just... quiet. I hope the numbers are kind.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I’m all set! I’ll check the morning routine and the unplanned shuffles. I really hope we can keep those precious gaps between meetings safe!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ve already picked my two. Sound and posture. I’ll see what the data says about comfort.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I’m glad we’re all looking into different angles. Let’s see what the data tells us about our neighbors and our comfort.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,We have our choices. Let’s see what the records reveal about who actually benefits from the current arrangement.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I hope the numbers are kind. I’ll wait quietly for the results.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mio,,I’m ready! I can’t wait to see how much time we’re actually losing. Let’s protect those little gaps!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Comfort is the only thing that stays with you after the meeting ends. Let’s see if the data agrees.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
