35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The plan gives four desks windows, but three face the wall. Daylight was the top complaint. Yet the new joiners learned by overhearing.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The badge records show early arrivals settle seats before half the team is in. Proximity also killed our written notes last spring.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found the billing is by area, not heads. Two empty desks cost 41,000 yen monthly. Moving a desk costs 6,200 yen.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Four to nine minutes every morning just to set up! Plus, those shuffles last two weeks each. That’s a huge chunk of my day gone.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Nine decibels louder by the printer, and my chair takes days to settle. Comfort isn't a luxury; it's a requirement.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"The joiners learned by overhearing, yet the plan puts three desks against the wall. We must balance daylight with the chance to listen.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"First-come, first-served is unfair. Early arrivals lock in the good spots before the rest of us even arrive.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: First-come, first-served is unfair. Early arrivals lock in the good spots before the rest of us even arrive.""}]}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"The 41,000 yen for empty space is painful. And 6,200 yen per move means we can’t just shuffle things around.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"Two weeks of chaos per shuffle is unacceptable. We need a layout that stays put, so I don’t lose my morning setup time again.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Mio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Mio: Two weeks of chaos per shuffle is unacceptable. We need a layout that stays put, so I don’t lose my morning setup time again.""}]}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"So the window side is quieter, but my chair needs days to settle. If we move, I lose that adjustment period. That’s a real cost.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"Shunichi, your point about settling in is wise. But Toshio, if we fix seats, do we lose the chance to overhear and learn?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"Shizue, proximity is valuable, but it shouldn't be a lottery. We need a system that guarantees fairness, not just chance.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m sorry. The 6,200 yen per move is a real barrier. We can’t afford to change things often.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"Exactly! If we rotate, I lose my settled setup every time. I need stability to protect my precious gaps.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Mio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Mio: Exactly! If we rotate, I lose my settled setup every time. I need stability to protect my precious gaps.""}]}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Toshio, fairness is fine, but my body doesn't care about your principles. If I lose my settled chair, I lose my afternoon.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I hear you all. We must balance the quiet of the window with the warmth of shared learning. Let us find a middle path.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"Shunichi, your body is valid. But if we fix seats, the early arrivals keep the quiet spots forever. That is the unfairness I refuse to accept.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: Shunichi, your body is valid. But if we fix seats, the early arrivals keep the quiet spots forever. That is the unfairness I refuse to accept.""}]}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m sorry. The 6,200 yen per move is a real barrier. We can’t afford to change things often.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,I can’t lose my setup time again. Stability is non-negotiable for me.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Toshio, you’re right that early birds win. But my body needs stability too. We need a system that respects both fairness and physical comfort.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
