60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I see three paths. Option A lets us choose neighbors daily, but Daisuke, the cost of moving is high. Option B gives stability, but Toshio, does it feel fair?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option A is a lottery. Option B locks in the early birds' advantage. Option C is the only one that forces a deliberate, shared rotation of the burden.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m sorry. Option C means paying 6,200 yen every time we shift blocks. That’s too expensive for our budget.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option C means losing my setup time every rotation. I can’t afford that. Option B keeps my gaps safe, but I worry about the noise.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option B is the only one that respects my body. Rotating blocks means losing my settled chair repeatedly. I need stability to survive the afternoon.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"I hear the worry about cost and comfort. But remember, the new joiners learned by overhearing. Option A keeps that door open, even if it is messy.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"Shizue, overhearing is a byproduct, not a plan. Option C is the only one that prevents the early arrivals from permanently hoarding the quiet, window-side desks.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m sorry. Option B means paying 6,200 yen once, but never again. Option C keeps charging us. I can only afford the one-time cost.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mio,,Option B is the only one that protects my precious gaps. Rotating blocks would destroy my morning routine. I need stability to survive the day.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Toshio, you’re right that early birds win. But my body needs stability too. We need a system that respects both fairness and physical comfort.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"Toshio, your fairness is vital, but Shunichi’s body needs rest. Daisuke, the one-time cost is kind. Can we balance these needs?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"Shizue, kindness is not a layout. Option C is the only one that prevents the early arrivals from permanently hoarding the quiet, window-side desks.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m sorry. Option B is the only one that stops the recurring 6,200 yen charges. I can’t afford the repeated costs of Option C.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mio,,Option B is the only choice that protects my precious gaps. Rotating blocks would destroy my morning routine. I need stability to survive the day.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Toshio, you keep saying C is the only fair option, but it’s the only one that breaks my body. I can’t keep resetting my chair.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,"I see the tension. Daisuke, Mio, and Shunichi need stability. Toshio, you need fairness. Can we find a way to honor both?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Mio"",""Shunichi"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"Shizue, I hear the pain. But if we choose B, we accept that the early arrivals keep the quiet forever. I cannot vote for that silence.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’m sorry. I can’t afford the repeated costs of Option C. Option B is the only one that stops the bleeding.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Mio,,Option B is the only one that protects my precious gaps. Rotating blocks would destroy my morning routine. I need stability to survive the day.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Toshio, your fairness is abstract; my back is not. Option B is the only one that lets me keep my settled chair. I vote B.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
